Package: libedit
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Depends: libsystem, ncurses
Description: line editing library (editline, readline)
 BSD editline library with command history, line editing and a readline
 compatibility interface.

Package: libedit-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libedit (= ${binary:Version})
Description: line editing library: development files
 Public histedit and readline headers for building against libedit.
 The link-time dylib aliases are supplied by libedit.
